 "dbr": -1.766, "dh": 2.02}, {"q": "2025-03-31", "avail": "2025-05-16", "h": 2338, "sh": 909833084, "N": 7987, "br": 29.273, "dbr": -0.008, "dh": 0.47}, {"q": "2025-06-30", "avail": "2025-08-15", "h": 2298, "sh": 954655394, "N": 8039, "br": 28.586, "dbr": -0.687, "dh": -1.71}, {"q": "2025-09-30", "avail": "2025-11-15", "h": 2217, "sh": 917348153, "N": 8024, "br": 27.63, "dbr": -0.956, "dh": -3.52}, {"q": "2025-12-31", "avail": "2026-02-15", "h": 2260, "sh": 916235467, "N": 8625, "br": 26.203, "dbr": -1.427, "dh": 1.94}, {"q": "2026-03-31", "avail": "2026-05-16", "h": 2310, "sh": 922509770, "N": 8741, "br": 26.427, "dbr": 0.224, "dh": 2.21}, {"q": "2026-06-30", "avail": "2026-08-15", "h": 2392, "sh": 1162672471, "N": 8857, "br": 27.007, "dbr": 0.58, "dh": 3.55}], "statements": {"n": 58, "from": "2017-01-25", "last": [{"d": "2026-10-29", "n": 3.85, "z": 0.4, "rz": -0.55, "earn": true, "q": "We had a terrific quarter and a great year driven by our focus on the fundamentals and what has always set Starbucks apart: exceptional coffee, a moment of connection and a world-class customer experience. This gives me confidence our performance is durable,", "a": "commented Brian Niccol, chairman and chief executive officer", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/829224/000082922426000154/sbux-09272026xearningsrele.htm"}, {"d": "2026-07-29", "n": 1.65, "z": -0.57, "rz": 0.73, "earn": true, "q": "Our Back to Starbucks plan was built on the belief that an extraordinary cup of coffee, human connection and customer experience win the day, every day. Our third quarter results are proof they do,", "a": "commented Brian Niccol, chairman and chief executive officer", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/829224/000082922426000129/sbux-06282026xearningsrele.htm"}, {"d": "2026-04-28", "n": 2.13, "z": -0.55, "rz": 0.28, "earn": true, "q": "Our second quarter marked the turn in our turnaround as our Back to Starbucks plan drove both top and bottom line growth,", "a": "commented Brian Niccol, chairman and chief executive officer", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/829224/000082922426000078/sbux-03292026xearningsrele.htm"}, {"d": "2026-04-02", "n": 7.45, "z": null, "rz": null, "earn": false, "q": "China remains one of the most exciting long-term opportunities for Starbucks, and finalizing this partnership with Boyu accelerates our ability to grow with intention and discipline,", "a": "said Brian Niccol, chairman and chief executive officer, Starbucks Coffee Company", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/829224/000082922426000064/sbux-04022026xexhibit991.htm"}, {"d": "2026-01-28", "n": 5.63, "z": 0.81, "rz": -0.42, "earn": true, "q": "Our Q1 results demonstrate our 'Back to Starbucks' strategy is working and we believe we're ahead of schedule,", "a": "commented Brian Niccol, chairman and chief executive officer", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/829224/000082922426000010/sbux-12282025xearningsrele.htm"}, {"d": "2025-11-03", "n": 6.56, "z": null, "rz": null, "earn": false, "q": "Boyu’s deep local knowledge and expertise will help accelerate our growth in China, especially as we expand into smaller cities and new regions. We’ve found a partner who shares our commitment to a great partner experience and world-class customer service. Together we will write the next chapter of Starbucks storied hi…", "a": "said Brian Niccol, chairman and chief executive officer, Starbucks Coffee Company.\"", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/829224/000082922425000079/a20251103-form8xkxex991.htm"}], "now": {"d": "2026-10-29", "z": 0.4, "mood": "usual"}, "say_do": {"mood": "usual", "acts": "none", "clash": false, "agree": false}}, "score": {"value": 45, "verdict": {"it": "Leggermente ribassista", "en": "Mildly bearish"}, "confidence": "Media", "covered_pct": 80, "missing": ["guid"], "subs": [{"id": "insider", "name": {"it": "Insider", "en": "Insiders"}, "w": 35, "v": 50, "why": [{"it": "Nessun acquisto dis